# Fetched by scripts/fetch-deps, never committed: the ReShade SDK, Dear ImGui and the TeamSpeak
# Plugin SDK. MinHook is the exception -- it is a small BSD-2 library that the .asi build links
# into the binary, its notice is in LICENSE, and vendoring it keeps the source archive buildable
# on its own. See teamspeak-reshade-overlay/third_party/minhook/UPSTREAM.md.
